00:40:31.520 --> 00:40:32.380
La conferma di magazzino

00:40:32.380 --> 00:40:33.340
stabilisce un passaggio

00:40:33.340 --> 00:40:34.060
ma il contenitore

00:40:34.060 --> 00:40:34.740
